    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nNo. 163 is a beautifully presented 3 bedroomed mid terrace home located in the highly regarded development of Leargan on the Western Distributor Road. Constructed by O'Malley Construction in 2015, the property has been well maintained by its current owners and is in excellent decorative order and is finished to a high standard. \n\nThe home is entered via hallway which incorporates guest wc and leads onto an open plan kitchen area to the front and a large living/dining area to the rear with double doors onto garden. On the first floor there are two large double bedrooms, one of which is en-suite, and the main bathroom. Leading up to the second floor presents main bathroom with ensuite and fantastic storage. There is also attic space on the landing with ample storage and offering a place to air clothes. There is a cobble-lock driveway with parking to the front door with a large green area, creche and children's playground located within the estate which is beautifully maintained. The rear garden has a paved patio area, with a lawn and block wall boundary. The property is heated by gas heating and also has the additional benefit of solar panels. The property also has the added benefit of a security alarm.\n\nLeargan is a very popular well serviced development located just off the Western Distributor Road which is serviced by public transport. Local amenities include Cappagh Sports Ground, Silver Strand Beach and Barna Woods and Gateway Shopping Centre."
      },
